 },
 "check": {
  "describe": "Five distinct weather icons (an amber sun with rays, a grey cloud, a cloud with blue drops, a cloud with blue dots, a cloud with an amber bolt), each labelled. Battery icons: the host level 76 (green, three quarters), 95 (green), 40 (amber), 10 (red with a !). Three banners: info (blue, circled i, with a cross), warn (amber, triangle, with a cross) and error (red, circled !, no cross). With battery = 10 (the low render) the first battery turns red, shows the ! and reads 10%. Resized, the weather columns are weighted (closer at 260 dp, spread at 520), the batteries wrap in a flow (two lines at 260 dp) and the banners fill the width.",
