 "pitfalls": [
  "The format has no portable system battery level (batteryLevel() is a json2rc extension the Java parser rejects, U31): the host sets an exported float, so render with variables {\"battery\": 10}, not system_variables",
  "WeatherIcon's condition is static: a host-chosen condition needs the five icons behind a stateLayout or visibility"
